Chief, ordinary people are watching.

225
00:12:45,380 --> 00:12:47,271
I see... well, it can't be helped.

226
00:12:47,321 --> 00:12:49,860
So your alarm clock
broke and the bus was late?

227
00:12:53,040 --> 00:12:56,220
You did study the traffic laws properly,
didn't you, Ryotsu?

228
00:12:56,920 --> 00:12:58,320
O-of course!

229
00:12:58,680 --> 00:13:02,800
