231
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:07,520
Don't mess with me.

232
00:13:07,520 --> 00:13:10,140
Chief, in front of people,
in front of people.

233
00:13:11,160 --> 00:13:15,020
Wrapping difficult traffic signs in gags,

234
00:13:15,020 --> 00:13:18,840
