Did the plan of getting him to be late,
so we'd think it was over, fail?

246
00:13:51,160 --> 00:13:53,180
Shall we start the next plan?

247
00:13:53,180 --> 00:13:55,600
Hey, Honda, can you hear me?

248
00:13:57,460 --> 00:14:01,840
I can't do that. Besides, I'm on patrol.

249
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:06,000
Sure, you're slacking off a little,
but what I say goes, you know.

250
00:14:07,700 --> 00:14:10,320
Fine, I'll go. Alright, alright.

251
00:14:10,880 --> 00:14:11,940
